WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.267
[cell phone vibrating]

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.969
I told you I don't know where it is,

00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:05.505
don't put things in my butt
if you want them back.

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:09.709
And hold for Princess Carolyn, please.

00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:10.777
Thanks, Laura.

